# Deliberately empty for now.
#
# rfloop.tcl already calls add_files for hdl/*.v and for its own constraints,
# and it is validated hardware. Listing the same files here as well makes
# Vivado warn about duplicate adds on every build.
#
# The cost is that Hog does not track these sources, so its "uncommitted
# files" check and changelog do not cover them. That is acceptable while the
# point is to prove the flow; migrating the file lists out of rfloop.tcl and
# into here is the natural follow-up, and it is what buys the traceability
# Hog exists for.
#
# rfloop/hdl/dac_tone_src.v
# rfloop/hdl/adc_capture_gate.v
